    builders: "Anthony & Sylvan operates in Connecticut with a Connecticut-licensed branch. Shoreline Pools (Stamford) is a leading high-end Fairfield County builder. Other established names include Aqua Pool & Patio (East Windsor), Total Tech Pools (Westport), and Custom Pools Inc. Connecticut Spa & Pool Association maintains a licensed-member directory.",
